Independent coordinator LunaHigh review ACCEPT; fresh main offline check and
111 named test entries pass, including all86unchanged prior assertions and25new
checks. Exact reviewed source integrated; original integration tests,603legacy
source files, HEAD and index preserved. Protected candidate audit compares1652
