RasterJob owns same-source/job storage, admitted requested/actual capacities,
metadata, old/new overlap and retained lifetimes, plus complete controlled lower
resource seams. Full engines/adapters, preserved mixed renderer oracles, native
app/runtime/performance/MCP/final QA/release/authentic demo remain required.

Decoder publication/request rollback and query's public ledger allocation gap
